1134-4886-aab2-ad2b7bce8279"],

Cell["\<\
Comparing with n (t \[Minus] t0) = et sinh u \[Minus] u gives the mean motion \
and the time eccentricity.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e0152b7d-4575-4673-b580-c95b8480a706"],

