Cell["\<\
Every coefficient agrees to working precision (40 digits), at Newtonian, 1PN \
and 1.5PN order.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"209190c6-58fc-443f-9a06-661c1c1b48bc"],

Cell["2. Numerical orbit", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"d0034e4b-56e6-4337-95f0-f7112892982a"],

Cell["\<\
Integrate d\.b2r/dt\.b2 = (1/2) d(dr/dt)\.b2/dr and d\[Phi]/dt from \
periastron at finite c, and compare with the quasi-Keplerian solution. The \
two differ at 2PN, so halving Xi should shrink the difference by about 16.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8d1fccc9-b677-49cb-b819-b0c3179b19cc"],

